  "description": "A simple TCP log server: connect with any telnet client to watch an application's log live. Meant for debugging; it has no authentication.",
  "id": "ScorpioConcepts.Framework.LogServer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-15T19:56:07.943Z",
