  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 and .NET Standard 2.0; .NET Framework targets have been dropped. Breaking changes: the default port is now 7446 instead of 446, so it runs without root on Linux; the events are now ClientConnected, ClientDisconnected and ServerError, using EventHandler<T>; LogHistory returns IReadOnlyList<string>; LogServer is sealed; Start() can only be called once. New: a constructor that takes the IPAddress to listen on, MaxClients and MaxQueuedLines limits, LocalEndpoint, ConnectedClients, IDisposable, UTF-8 output, and async I/O instead of a thread per client.",
